  "readme": "## README.md\n# BlueSky Canada Smoke Forecast in zarr-v3\n\nThis data product contains the [BlueSky Canada smoke forecast](https://firesmoke.ca/about/) from the Weather Forecast Research Team at the University of British Columbia, reprocessed in zarr-v3 format.\n\nIt updates 4 times daily from Github Actions workflows.\n\n* Github: https://github.com/alukach/firesmoke/\n* FireSmoke: https://firesmoke.ca\n",
